v 3
d 'EQUAIDS': module to estimate AIDS and QUAIDS demand systems with survey data
d
d  equaids estimates the almost ideal demand system (Deaton and Muellbauer
d  1980) and its quadratic extension (Banks, Blundell and Lewbel 1997), with
d  demographics by Ray's scaling, by iterated feasible generalized nonlinear
d  least squares (Gauss-Newton with an analytic Jacobian, in Mata). It
d  reports the elasticities of the households (the mean of the household
d  elasticities, the default), of the individuals (weights times household
d  size), of the market (aggregate) and of a reference household (at the
d  means), all with analytic standard errors from the exact influence
d  function of the whole procedure: robust, by cluster or by survey design
d  (svyset), or a bootstrap of the whole procedure. The missing prices of the
d  non-buyers are filled by group means (pimpute), and the non-buyers are
d  corrected for by the two-step method of Shonkwiler and Yen (1999)
d  (selection), with the probits and the imputation in the standard errors.
d  equaidsdiag and estat diagnostics check the data and the fit; estat engel
d  gives the Engel curves; tables with significance stars can be written to
d  Word, LaTeX, Excel, CSV or Markdown; a dialog box and help examples run
d  from clickable links are included. A technical note documents the model,
d  the estimator and the validation of the standard errors; it is included as
d  an ancillary file (equaids_technical_note.pdf) and on Zenodo:
d  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22959991
d
d KW: demand system
d KW: AIDS
d KW: QUAIDS
d KW: price elasticities
d KW: household survey
d KW: censoring
d KW: survey design
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.2
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261001
d
d Author: Abdelkrim Araar, Universite Laval and Partnership for Economic Policy (PEP)
d Support: email aabd@ecn.ulaval.ca
d
d (A copy of the package as submitted to the SSC archive, version 1.2.1, to
d test it before SSC publishes it: the example data and the other ancillary
d files are copied to the current folder by net get.)
d
f equaids.ado
f equaids.sthlp
f equaids.dlg
f equaids_estat.ado
f _equaids_tabstars.ado
f _equaids_pimpute.ado
f equaidsdiag.ado
f equaidsdiag.sthlp
f equaids_examples.ado
f mexico_2014_cereals.dta
f equaids_nonbuyers.dta
f equaids_technical_note.pdf
